&lt;p&gt;The transportation industry has undergone a remarkable transformation over the past decade, driven by rapid advancements in mobile technology and changing consumer expectations. People today prefer convenience, speed, and flexibility when booking transportation services. This shift has significantly increased the demand for digital mobility solutions, making Ride Hailing App Development one of the fastest-growing sectors in the technology industry.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ride hailing applications enable users to book rides through smartphones, connect with nearby drivers, track their journeys in real time, and make secure cashless payments. Businesses worldwide are leveraging these innovative solutions to establish successful ride-sharing platforms and capture new market opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Understanding Ride Hailing App Development&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ride Hailing App Development refers to the process of designing and building mobile and web applications that facilitate transportation services between passengers and drivers. These platforms simplify the entire ride-booking process, from requesting a ride to completing payments and collecting customer feedback.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A complete ride hailing ecosystem generally consists of:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Passenger Application&lt;br&gt;
Driver Application&lt;br&gt;
Administrative Dashboard&lt;br&gt;
Dispatch Management System&lt;br&gt;
Analytics and Reporting Module&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Together, these components create a seamless and efficient transportation experience.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Growing Demand for Ride Hailing Solutions&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Modern consumers value accessibility and convenience more than ever before. Traditional taxi services are increasingly being replaced by app-based booking systems that provide instant access to transportation services.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Several factors contribute to the growing popularity of ride hailing platforms:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Increasing smartphone adoption.&lt;br&gt;
Availability of internet connectivity.&lt;br&gt;
Preference for cashless transactions.&lt;br&gt;
Demand for real-time tracking.&lt;br&gt;
Improved passenger safety features.&lt;br&gt;
Growing urban populations.&lt;br&gt;
Expansion of the gig economy.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As a result, entrepreneurs and transportation companies are investing heavily in Ride Hailing App Development to remain competitive.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Key Features of Ride Hailing Applications&lt;br&gt;
Passenger Application Features&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Passengers expect an intuitive and user-friendly experience. Essential features include:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Quick registration and login.&lt;br&gt;
Ride booking in a few taps.&lt;br&gt;
Live driver tracking.&lt;br&gt;
Fare estimation.&lt;br&gt;
Multiple payment options.&lt;br&gt;
Ride scheduling.&lt;br&gt;
Push notifications.&lt;br&gt;
Driver details and ratings.&lt;br&gt;
Trip history.&lt;br&gt;
Emergency support.&lt;br&gt;
Driver Application Features&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Driver applications are designed to improve efficiency and maximize earnings.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Important functionalities include:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Driver profile management.&lt;br&gt;
Ride request alerts.&lt;br&gt;
Navigation assistance.&lt;br&gt;
Earnings reports.&lt;br&gt;
Trip history.&lt;br&gt;
Online and offline availability.&lt;br&gt;
Ratings and reviews.&lt;br&gt;
Performance insights.&lt;br&gt;
Secure communication tools.&lt;br&gt;
Admin Dashboard Features&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The admin panel serves as the operational backbone of the platform.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Core features include:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;User management.&lt;br&gt;
Driver verification.&lt;br&gt;
Ride monitoring.&lt;br&gt;
Commission configuration.&lt;br&gt;
Payment tracking.&lt;br&gt;
Promotional campaign management.&lt;br&gt;
Customer support management.&lt;br&gt;
Business analytics.&lt;br&gt;
Geographic expansion controls.&lt;br&gt;
Technologies Used in Ride Hailing App Development&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Modern ride hailing applications are powered by advanced technologies that ensure reliability, security, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Common technologies include:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;GPS and Geolocation Services&lt;br&gt;
Cloud Computing&lt;br&gt;
Artificial Intelligence&lt;br&gt;
Machine Learning&lt;br&gt;
Real-Time Database Systems&lt;br&gt;
Payment Gateway Integration&lt;br&gt;
Push Notification Services&lt;br&gt;
API Integrations&lt;br&gt;
Business Intelligence Tools&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These technologies help deliver seamless user experiences while supporting business growth.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Business Benefits of Ride Hailing App Development&lt;br&gt;
Increased Revenue Generation&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ride hailing platforms create multiple income streams through ride commissions, subscription models, advertising opportunities, and premium services.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Enhanced Customer Experience&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Passengers enjoy a convenient booking process, transparent pricing, and secure payment options.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Operational Efficiency&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Automation reduces manual intervention and streamlines transportation operations.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Scalability&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Businesses can expand their services into multiple locations without significant infrastructure investments.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Competitive Advantage&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Offering innovative mobility solutions enables businesses to differentiate themselves in a competitive market.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Challenges in Ride Hailing App Development&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Despite its advantages, developing a ride hailing application presents several challenges:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ensuring passenger and driver safety.&lt;br&gt;
Managing real-time ride allocation.&lt;br&gt;
Handling peak demand efficiently.&lt;br&gt;
Maintaining data privacy and security.&lt;br&gt;
Complying with local transportation regulations.&lt;br&gt;
Providing uninterrupted service availability.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Addressing these challenges requires careful planning and technical expertise.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Future Trends in Ride Hailing Applications&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The ride hailing industry continues to evolve through technological innovation. Future developments are expected to include:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Electric vehicle integration.&lt;br&gt;
Autonomous transportation support.&lt;br&gt;
AI-driven route optimization.&lt;br&gt;
Voice-enabled ride booking.&lt;br&gt;
Predictive demand analysis.&lt;br&gt;
Contactless passenger experiences.&lt;br&gt;
Sustainable mobility initiatives.&lt;br&gt;
Advanced safety technologies.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Businesses that adopt these trends early can establish long-term market leadership.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Why Invest in Ride Hailing App Development?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Investing in Ride Hailing App Development allows businesses to capitalize on the growing demand for on-demand transportation services. Whether targeting local communities or global markets, ride hailing applications provide opportunities to increase revenue, improve customer engagement, and expand operational capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A &lt;a href="https://fenizomlmsoft.com/ride-hailing-app-development/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;professionally developed platform&lt;/a&gt; can help businesses:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Launch transportation services quickly.&lt;br&gt;
Deliver exceptional user experiences.&lt;br&gt;
Build customer trust and loyalty.&lt;br&gt;
Optimize operational workflows.&lt;br&gt;
Achieve sustainable business growth.&lt;br&gt;
Conclusion&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ride Hailing App Development has revolutionized the transportation industry by creating efficient, accessible, and customer-focused mobility solutions. With the increasing adoption of smartphones and digital services, the demand for ride-sharing applications continues to grow worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Businesses that embrace this digital transformation can unlock significant opportunities for innovation and profitability. By incorporating advanced technologies, user-centric features, and scalable infrastructure, organizations can build successful ride hailing platforms that meet the evolving needs of modern consumers.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As the future of transportation moves toward smarter and more connected mobility ecosystems, investing in Ride Hailing App Development represents a strategic step toward long-term success.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;React provides several hooks to improve performance and manage state efficiently. One of these hooks is &lt;code&gt;useMemo&lt;/code&gt;, which is used to memoize expensive calculations and avoid unnecessary re-computations during component re-renders.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  What is useMemo?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;useMemo&lt;/code&gt; is a React Hook that stores the result of a calculation and only recalculates it when one of its dependencies changes. This helps improve application performance by preventing expensive operations from running on every render.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


  Syntax
&lt;/h3&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight jsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;memoizedValue&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useMemo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;expensiveCalculation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;();&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;dependencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The first argument is a function that returns a value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The second argument is a dependency array.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;React recalculates the value only when a dependency changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Why use useMemo?
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When a component re-renders, all calculations inside the component are executed again. For simple calculations, this is not a problem. However, for expensive operations such as filtering, sorting, or processing large datasets, repeated calculations can affect performance.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;useMemo&lt;/code&gt; helps by caching the result and reusing it until the dependencies change.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Example Without useMemo
&lt;/h2&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight jsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;React&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;react&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;App&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;setCount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;text&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;setText&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;""&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;

  &lt;span class="nx"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;Calculating...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;square&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;

  &lt;span class="k"&gt;return &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;Count: &lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;Square: &lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;square&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;onClick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;setCount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
        Increment
      &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;input&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="na"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"text"&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="na"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;text&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="na"&gt;onChange&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;setText&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;target&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;default&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;App&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;In this example, typing in the input field causes the component to re-render, and the calculation runs again even though the count value has not changed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Example With useMemo
&lt;/h2&gt;



&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight jsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;React&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;useMemo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;react&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="kd"&gt;function&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;App&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;setCount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;text&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;setText&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;""&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;

  &lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;square&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useMemo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="nx"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;Calculating...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]);&lt;/span&gt;

  &lt;span class="k"&gt;return &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;Count: &lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;Square: &lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;square&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;h2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;onClick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;setCount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;count&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
        Increment
      &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;input&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="na"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"text"&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="na"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;text&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="na"&gt;onChange&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;setText&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;target&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;default&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;App&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Now the calculation runs only when the &lt;code&gt;count&lt;/code&gt; value changes. Updating the input field will not trigger the calculation again.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  Advantages of useMemo
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improves performance by avoiding unnecessary calculations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduces processing time for expensive operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Useful when working with large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helps optimize React applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


  When to Use useMemo
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Use &lt;code&gt;useMemo&lt;/code&gt; for:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sorting large arrays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Filtering large datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex mathematical calculations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating stable object or array references&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Example:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight jsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;sortedUsers&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;useMemo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;users&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;sort&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;((&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;age&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;age&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;users&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;h2&gt;


  When Not to Use useMemo
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Do not use &lt;code&gt;useMemo&lt;/code&gt; for simple calculations because it introduces its own overhead.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight jsx"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;total&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Using &lt;code&gt;useMemo&lt;/code&gt; for simple operations often provides no performance benefit.&lt;/p&gt;

